一天会接到几百个骚扰电话。记者从市场监管部门了解到，芸豆分APP属于上海醉梦者互联网科技有限公司，经查询该公司并不具备金融许可，在APP页面中也没有任何关于额度与利率的提示。记者以借款者的身份拨通了这家公司的电话，接电话的工作人员劝告记者不要借，因为“利率挺高的”。对此律师表示，根据相关法律规定，一年期贷款市场报价利率（LPR）超过12%的属于法律不受保护的范围，可以不用支付。此外，“爆通讯录”属于明确的侵权行为，属于软暴力催收，违法者会受到公安机关罚款或者拘留的处罚。最终，李先生选择了报警，公安机关介入后解决了问题。网贷3000元1个月后被要求还30000网贷利率1460%不还被威胁爆通讯录"},"attached_info":"CkoIpeaVqMKyq6ZREAMaCTExNDY0MjkwMyCE76HABjAAOIMCQAtyEzE4OTgzNjQ0MjIyNTYyODkyMjF4AKoBCWJpbGxib2FyZNIBAA==","detail_text":"145 万热度","trend":0,"debut":false,"children":[{"type":"answer","thumbnail":"https://pic1.zhimg.com/80/v2-df7b089fe67bc94152ce02143e137778_1440w.webp?source=1def8aca"}]},{"type":"hot_list_feed","style_type":"1","id":"12_1745508076.694271","card_id":"Q_1897611599767916596","target":{"id":1897611599767916500,"title":"REDMI Turbo 4 Pro 发布会定档 4 月 24 日，新机有哪些亮点值得期待？","url":"https://api.zhihu.com/questions/1897611599767916596","type":"question","created":1745205861,"answer_count":42,"follower_count":64,"author":{"type":"people","user_type":"people","id":"0","url_token":"","url":"","name":"用户","headline":"","avatar_url":"https://pica.zhimg.com/aadd7b895_s.jpg"},"bound_topic_ids":[488,11754,25405,108756,3617070],"comment_count":0,"is_following":false,"excerpt":"[图片]"},"attached_info":"CkkIpeaVqMKyq6ZREAMaCTExNDYwNTg2NiDl9JbABjAAOEBADHITMTg5NzYxMTU5OTc2NzkxNjU5NngAqgEJYmlsbGJvYXJk0gEA","detail_text":"134 万热度","trend":0,"debut":false,"children":[{"type":"answer","thumbnail":"https://pic2.zhimg.com/50/v2-53fca0c43ea1abad61f51c44318b6b45_b.jpg"}]},{"type":"hot_list_feed","style_type":"1","id":"13_1745508076.694577","card_id":"Q_1898492637964645096","card_label":{"type":"hot","icon":"https://pic2.zhimg.com/80/v2-266e83dbee46dce23b718e0531cb7d3a_1440w.png","night_icon":"https://pic3.zhimg.com/80/v2-c89199839c237b87e52f010bb5e7d773_1440w.png"},"target":{"id":1898492637964645000,"title":"特朗普态度缓和，美股集体高开，特斯拉涨超 7%，如何解读？美股后续走势会如何发展？","url":"https://api.zhihu.com/questions/1898492637964645096","type":"question","created":1745415917,"answer_count":22,"follow